    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 120,
      "zh": "🧠 记忆秘诀",
      "en": "🧠 Memory Tips"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 121,
      "zh": "开局偷看的那一秒要抓紧！翻牌时有规律地一行一行翻，把图案和位置编成小故事，比如「左上角的小狗在追右下角的小猫」，会记得更牢。",
      "en": "Use the peek second wisely! Flip cards row by row in order, and turn positions into little stories — \"the puppy in the top left is chasing the kitten in the bottom right\" — they stick much better."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 125,
      "zh": "📖 关于这款游戏",
      "en": "📖 About this game"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 125,
      "zh": "记忆翻牌（Memory / 翻牌配对）网页版：每回合翻开两张卡片，图案相同就配对成功，找出所有配对即可获胜。提供简单 4×3、普通 4×4、困难 5×4、大师 6×5 四档难度，动物、水果、太空、海洋四套卡面，单人计时挑战或双人轮流对战，3D 翻牌动画，开局有偷看时间。锻炼记忆力和专注力，适合小朋友和全家一起玩，完全免费。",
      "en": "Memory Match in your browser: flip two cards each turn; matching pictures make a pair, and finding every pair wins. Four difficulties — Easy 4×3, Normal 4×4, Hard 5×4 and Master 6×5 — four card themes (animals, fruits, space, ocean), timed solo play or 2-player turns, smooth 3D flips and a peek at the start. Great memory training for kids and families, completely free."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 126,
      "zh": "🕹️ 打开即玩 · 完全免费 · 支持鼠标、键盘和触屏",
      "en": "🕹️ Play instantly · Free · Mouse, keyboard & touch"
    },
