    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 140,
      "zh": "记忆翻牌（Memory / 翻牌配对）网页版：每回合翻开两张卡片，图案相同就配对成功，找出所有配对即可获胜。提供简单 4×3、普通 4×4、困难 5×4、大师 6×5 四档难度，动物、水果、太空、海洋四套卡面，单人计时挑战或双人轮流对战，3D 翻牌动画，开局有偷看时间。锻炼记忆力和专注力，适合小朋友和全家一起玩，完全免费。",
      "en": "Memory Match in your browser: flip two cards each turn; matching pictures make a pair, and finding every pair wins. Four difficulties — Easy 4×3, Normal 4×4, Hard 5×4 and Master 6×5 — four card themes (animals, fruits, space, ocean), timed solo play or 2-player turns, smooth 3D flips and a peek at the start. Great memory training for kids and families, completely free."
    },
